This repository contains only a build recipe (a GitHub Actions workflow and its
documentation). It contains no Geovoya application code.

The workflow is trivial and is released under the MIT licence, below.

Geovoya itself is separate work licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later. The installers this
workflow produces are builds of that GPL-3.0-or-later source, and they remain governed
by the GPL-3.0-or-later terms and by the LICENSE file shipped inside the published
source tarball. Nothing here relicenses Geovoya.

